      },
      "content": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0881",
      "reading_order": 960,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 698.1027600000001,
        "r": 503.95424399999985,
        "b": 677.2075290491804
      },
      "content": "Recommended tools for this procedure are an X-acto knife,  a  medium  size  flat  blade screwdriver, and long needle nose pliers."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0882",
      "reading_order": 961,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 662.1033360000001,
        "r": 294.1378799999998,
        "b": 653.2079130491804
      },
      "content": "The replacement parts for this procedure are:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0883",
      "reading_order": 962,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.999712,
        "t": 644.1036240000001,
        "r": 257.8685399999998,
        "b": 635.3471920327869
      },
      "content": "Assembly, Volume Control Knob"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0884",
      "reading_order": 963,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.999712,
        "t": 630.123768,
        "r": 143.32455599999994,
        "b": 621.3673360327869
      },
      "content": "Cap, Knob"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0885",
      "reading_order": 964,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.999712,
        "t": 616.143912,
        "r": 145.3554,
        "b": 607.3874800327868
      },
      "content": "Cover, Nut"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0886",
      "reading_order": 965,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 590.103492,
        "r": 504.147468,
        "b": 581.2080690491803
      },
      "content": "To replace the volume control knob, see Figure 7-4 and Figure 7-6 , then proceed as follows:",
      "hyperlink_hint": true
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0887",
      "reading_order": 966,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000001,
        "t": 566.1038759999999,
        "r": 408.2336639999995,
        "b": 557.2084530491802
      },
      "content": "Turn off the infuser and disconnect the device from AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0888",
      "reading_order": 967,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000001,
        "t": 550.6838039999999,
        "r": 344.0474400000001,
        "b": 541.7883810491802
      },
      "content": "Remove the battery as described in Section 7.2.4 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0889",
      "reading_order": 968,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000006,
        "t": 535.2637319999999,
        "r": 277.4020919999999,
        "b": 526.3683090491802
      },
      "content": "Carefully set the infuser face down."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0890",
      "reading_order": 969,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000006,
        "t": 519.7838999999999,
        "r": 408.0075720000001,
        "b": 510.88847704918015
      },
      "content": "Remove the peripheral assembly as described in Section 7.2.6 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0891",
      "reading_order": 970,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000006,
        "t": 504.36382799999984,
        "r": 503.97814800000066,
        "b": 484.00842904918017
      },
      "content": "Using the X-acto knife, lift the volume control knob end cap away from the knob, exposing a flat head screw."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0892",
      "reading_order": 971,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57940000000002,
        "t": 477.48377999999985,
        "r": 463.46684400000095,
        "b": 468.58835704918016
      },
      "content": "Using the flat blade screwdriver, remove the screw that secures the knob."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0893",
      "reading_order": 972,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57940000000002,
        "t": 462.06370799999985,
        "r": 413.6110679999997,
        "b": 453.16828504918016
      },
      "content": "Using long needle nose pliers, remove the volume control knob."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0894",
      "reading_order": 973,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57940000000002,
        "t": 446.58387599999986,
        "r": 504.00703200000004,
        "b": 437.68845304918017
      },
      "content": "Install the replacement volume control knob in the exact reverse order of removal."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0895",
      "reading_order": 974,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57940000000005,
        "t": 431.16380399999986,
        "r": 447.0617280000006,
        "b": 422.26838104918016
      },
      "content": "Replace the peripheral assembly in the exact reverse order of removal."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0896",
      "reading_order": 975,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 83.39922000000004,
        "t": 415.74373199999985,
        "r": 384.3675119999998,
        "b": 406.84830904918016
      },
      "content": "Reinstall the battery and connect the device to AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0897",
      "reading_order": 976,
      "section": "VOLUME CONTROL KNOB REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 71.99900400000004,
        "t": 392.28394799999984,
        "r": 492.3657840000001,
        "b": 383.38852504918015
      },
      "content": "To verify successful volume control knob replacement, perform the PVT in Section 5.2 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0898",
      "reading_order": 977,
      "section": "7.2.7.2",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 71.99900400000001,
        "t": 360.30437999999987,
        "r": 99.47864399999999,
        "b": 350.989763305785
      },
      "content": "7.2.7.2",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0899",
      "reading_order": 978,
      "section": "PERIPHERAL COVER REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 348.34038,
