        "b": 173.52853603278686
      },
      "content": "Cover, DataPort Connector Seal, Round Screw, 4-40 x 3/8, Hex Head, Nylon Washer, Flat, .128 Dia., Nylon Nut, Hex, Nurse Call Jack"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0904",
